{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gold and Bricks is a small game that mixes elements of city builder, roguelite, strategy and tower defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a small town with buildings that combo and synergize with each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan the layout, manage your economy and invest your gold in defensive towers to protect yourself from the hordes of enemies invading your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-4 different maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-permanent upgrades that can be unlocked as you play the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-13 different structures that can be combined to form different strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-cute visuals</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709390?t=1746488677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709390?t=1746488677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709390/033790f1436818208d07df43ca735c3dee50a862/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746488677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709390/033790f1436818208d07df43ca735c3dee50a862/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746488677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gold and Bricks is a small game that mixes elements of city builder, roguelite, strategy and tower defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a small town with buildings that combo and synergize with each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan the layout, manage your economy and invest your gold in defensive towers to protect yourself from the hordes of enemies invading your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class